; kilim.storage: localStorage and sessionStorage as tasks with a result, above
; one global driver record. It uses only the standard library and kilim, thus
; Storage_mock of kilim.testing runs as native code. kilim.storage.browser
; (browser/) gives the driver on the Web Storage API. The rule of the banned
; modules of the core applies (test/link).

(library
 (name kilim_storage)
 (public_name kilim.storage)
 (libraries kilim)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
